I could bring a couple of these amazing apples.

2061
02:20:14,390 --> 02:20:15,150
Just one.

2062
02:20:15,790 --> 02:20:18,270
Let's just put one of those on and go to town.

2063
02:20:19,270 --> 02:20:19,810
Huh?

2064
