2092
02:21:57,660 --> 02:21:58,380
Oh yeah, raw salmon.

2093
02:21:58,980 --> 02:21:59,820
In you go.

2094
02:22:00,620 --> 02:22:01,900
Enchanted golden apple.

2095
02:22:03,140 --> 02:22:04,120
These ones.

2096
02:22:04,660 --> 02:22:06,460
We have this one for range.

2097
02:22:07,560 --> 02:22:08,160
Sword.

2098
02:22:08,920 --> 02:22:09,520
Yep.

2099
02:22:10,780 --> 02:22:12,860
I think we may be good.

2100
02:22:13,530 --> 02:22:15,870
