2104
02:22:23,470 --> 02:22:24,350
Erika's still alive.

2105
02:22:24,650 --> 02:22:26,230
Let that fuel your loneliness.

2106
02:22:26,610 --> 02:22:29,770
I mean, let it combat the loneliness that is being fueled.

2107
02:22:30,490 --> 02:22:31,490
I can't speak.

2108
02:22:31,830 --> 02:22:32,850
You know what I mean.

2109
02:22:32,950 --> 02:22:33,550
