That chamber was underneath my house the entire time.

2113
02:22:54,720 --> 02:22:55,920
Also, I need to remove this.

2114
02:22:56,000 --> 02:22:56,500
This is ugly.

2115
02:23:05,060 --> 02:23:05,860
Here we go.

2116
